<title>UK: PLDT prices $200 mln 10-year global bond.</title>
<headline>PLDT prices $200 mln 10-year global bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced on</p>
<p>Monday by joint lead managers Goldman Sachs and Citicorp, has</p>
<p>been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   PHILIPPINE LONG-DISTANCE TELEPHONE</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     7.85	MATURITY    06.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.924    PAY DATE    06.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.875     REOFFER    99.924    SPREAD	+150 BP</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  0.50	YIELD	 7.86 PCT</p>
<p> MOODY/s&amp;p  BA2/BB+   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  PHIL	TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
